Well, I've examined the Monsteed patch further, and I've come across a
particularly serious bug: 'C'alling a mounted monster something will
_crash_ the game. This update doesn't fix that - but it does fix a load
of minor bugs and adds a few more features. For example:

* I integrated Webb's Warg Steed patch into it, to allow player orcs to
ride wargs (and other large wolves) as well as the other orcs.
* If you consult http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valkyrie ,  you'll note
that traditionally valkyries rode on the backs of wolves. So, valkyries
get to ride wolves as well. Differentiation!
* Endgame player-monster knights and valkyries can be found on the
backs of ki-rin, dragons or jabberwocks.

Expect more stuff in the future.

